  lore:
  - id: ghost-wire/0
    title: Authorized traffic
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Ghost in the Wire
    text: 'AEGIS / SERVICE TICKET: The community network outage was recorded as authorized load testing. No request came from the network''s owners. Approval originated in a Morrow procurement account.'
  - id: ghost-wire/1
    title: A borrowed key
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Ghost in the Wire
    text: 'Audit excerpt: The same maintenance credential crossed three systems in eleven seconds. The credential belongs to an engineer whose access was revoked six months ago. Someone kept the key active.'
  - id: ghost-wire/2
    title: Someone answered
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Ghost in the Wire
    text: 'Recovered radio transcript: NULL asked if anyone could still hear the neighborhood relay. Twelve operators answered. By dawn, the clinic and the night school were back online.'
